    narr:narration """The infrastructure strategy has coalesced around the adoption of [Zypherion for the analytics pipeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1), a decision ratified on August 9, 2026. This shift is grounded in a specific performance claim, citing a [15x improvement on columnar queries](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) compared to the existing architecture. The transition is currently scheduled to [commence in the third quarter of 2026](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3). This trajectory is reinforced by editorial summaries that formalize the [database selection](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [performance benchmarks](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [migration timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) as settled organizational commitments. The documentation reflects a unified push toward this new standard, framing the choice as both a technical necessity and a firm operational mandate.""" ;
